1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,220
I got tired of this.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,570
So I combined three of my projects to automate my job search.

3
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:09,297
Aria, run the job pipeline.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,090
Every 24 hours, Aria fills the new postings. Best fit first.

5
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:18,593
Coldstart finds the right person to email.

6
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:21,857
And drafts it. Never sent without me.

7
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:27,733
Every AI call goes through GateLLM. It routes each call to the cheapest model that can handle it.

8
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:35,573
Same 87 tasks. A frontier agent: $3.01. Routed through GateLLM: $0.21. Similar quality.

9
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:37,167
It never submits.

10
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:37,927
I do.
